# This tool's worker image, named by a local deep-deps mount (the path is
# relative to THIS directory; the root `.caos-expr` deepens the repo).
#
# caos/imgtools, NOT caos/nim: this tool assembles an image, it does not
# compile one. It needs jq and a tar, which the Nim toolchain image
# deliberately does not carry.
../../caos/imgtools imgtools

# The two game binaries come from `build`, which runs on the Nim image. Its
# worker script is curried as an ordinary arg, so this tool never needs a Nim
# toolchain of its own.
../../caos/nim nim
